Package	                                         Use
react-data-table-component =>	Data ko table format me dikhane ke liye. Sorting, pagination, search jaise features ready-made milte hain. Employee list dikhane me useful.
styled-components => 	CSS ko JavaScript ke andar likhne ke liye. Component-specific styling kar sakte ho.
axios	=>              Backend API ko call karne ke liye. Employee add, update, delete, fetch karne me use hoga.
react-icons =>       	Different icon libraries ke icons use karne ke liye. Edit, Delete, Search, User icons etc.
react-router-dom => 	React application me page navigation ke liye. Login → Dashboard → Employee List → Add Employee pages ke routes banane me use hota hai.
tailwindcss	=>          Utility-first CSS framework. Fast UI design karne ke liye.
postcss	=>              CSS ko process karne ke liye. Tailwind internally iska use karta hai.
autoprefixer =>      	Browser compatibility ke liye CSS prefixes automatically add karta hai (-webkit-, -moz-, etc.).